    "detailed_description": "Craft custom liquids with mind-bending properties and create scenes using the Scene Editor! Enjoy 60+ simulations that bring realism to destruction with shatter physics, soft body dynamics, real-time fluid simulation, structural integrity, and countless exciting features!<br><br>Unleash the raw power of fluid dynamics in over 60 simulations. Shatter objects, crumple metal using soft body physics, or obliterate structures leveraging real-time structural integrity mechanics.<br><br>Note: &quot;Liquid Havoc&quot; is not a game and there is no concept of winning or losing. It is a sandbox of many possibilities, where your imagination is the only limit.<br><br>New objects and improvements to the editor may be added in the future with support, feedback and the success of the simulation.<br>Make sure to try all the simulations. Don't prefer a simulation? Simply skip it and move onto the next by pressing F2.<br><br>Press Tab while playing to view the controls and tutorial:<br><br>Let me know your thoughts in the discussions, I will use the funds generated from this game to help fund this game or my other projects.  I appreciate all of the support!<br><br><strong>Modify Liquid Properties</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005570/extras/260c5ac23b07563b5b53c4029e11f115.avif?t=1695335314\" /></div>.<br><br><strong>Destroy Structures and Play with AI</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005570/extras/323e9c2aa9bae6a5363360b657d0b318.avif?t=1695335314\" /></div>.<br><br>Trailer music: Press Fuse by French Fuse",
    "about_the_game": "Craft custom liquids with mind-bending properties and create scenes using the Scene Editor! Enjoy 60+ simulations that bring realism to destruction with shatter physics, soft body dynamics, real-time fluid simulation, structural integrity, and countless exciting features!<br><br>Unleash the raw power of fluid dynamics in over 60 simulations. Shatter objects, crumple metal using soft body physics, or obliterate structures leveraging real-time structural integrity mechanics.<br><br>Note: &quot;Liquid Havoc&quot; is not a game and there is no concept of winning or losing. It is a sandbox of many possibilities, where your imagination is the only limit.<br><br>New objects and improvements to the editor may be added in the future with support, feedback and the success of the simulation.<br>Make sure to try all the simulations. Don't prefer a simulation? Simply skip it and move onto the next by pressing F2.<br><br>Press Tab while playing to view the controls and tutorial:<br><br>Let me know your thoughts in the discussions, I will use the funds generated from this game to help fund this game or my other projects.  I appreciate all of the support!<br><br><strong>Modify Liquid Properties</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005570/extras/260c5ac23b07563b5b53c4029e11f115.avif?t=1695335314\" /></div>.<br><br><strong>Destroy Structures and Play with AI</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005570/extras/323e9c2aa9bae6a5363360b657d0b318.avif?t=1695335314\" /></div>.<br><br>Trailer music: Press Fuse by French Fuse",
